   "text": "\ud83c\udfac 25 YEARS OF HARRY POTTER \ud83c\udfac\nHarry Potter and the Sorcerer's Stone released on November 16, 2001 \u2014 25 years ago \u2014 and a generation found its way to Hogwarts.\nTo mark the anniversary, we're spotlighting a fan edit from the collection: Harry Potter and The Sorcerer's Stone - ADigitalMan Cut - Fan Edit.\nADigitalMan's cut of the first film \u2014 Harry's first year at Hogwarts, tightened up as a single fan edit.\nDM us for the link \u2014 THE WORLD'S LARGEST FAN EDIT COLLECTION.",
